<article class="ltx_document ltx_fleqn">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">SPI-BoTER: Error Compensation for Industrial Robots via Sparse Attention Masking and Hybrid Loss with Spatial-Physical Information </h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
