<span id="S4.T7.5.3.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:170.7pt;">
<span id="S4.T7.5.3.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">Remove the sparse self-attention mask</span>
</span></td>
<td id="S4.T7.5.3.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="S4.T7.5.3.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:170.7pt;">
<span id="S4.T7.5.3.3.1.1" class="ltx_p">Evaluate necessity of the masking mechanism</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="S4.T7.5.4" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="S4.T7.5.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row">Body Mask</th>
<td id="S4.T7.5.4.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="S4.T7.5.4.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:170.7pt;">
<span id="S4.T7.5.4.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">Replace with BoT mask design</span>
</span></td>
<td id="S4.T7.5.4.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="S4.T7.5.4.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:170.7pt;">
<span id="S4.T7.5.4.3.1.1" class="ltx_p">Evaluate superiority of the proposed masking strategy</span>
</span></td></tr>
